WEBVTT

00:01.670 --> 00:03.480
What business do you have here?

00:04.070 --> 00:06.340
I've got a debt to repay.

00:07.110 --> 00:09.610
Show your face, Kenichiro!

00:25.840 --> 00:26.960
Matakara!

00:28.690 --> 00:29.880
Why?

00:29.880 --> 00:31.430
Please at least tell us the reason.

00:32.600 --> 00:35.680
Answer that yourself, chickenshit!

00:35.680 --> 00:36.770
Screw you, punk!

00:36.770 --> 00:38.090
You're the ones playing dirty!

00:38.090 --> 00:39.060
I'll smash your face in!

00:39.060 --> 00:41.910
Who the hell do you 
think you are, Jabashiri?

00:41.910 --> 00:44.820
You're the asshole cowards who 
ganged up and jumped our guys

00:44.820 --> 00:46.570
and left them spread out like that!

00:46.570 --> 00:48.320
Like what?

00:48.320 --> 00:51.820
You stuck them in those 
flashy boxers! Right?!

00:51.820 --> 00:55.950
Huh?! Well, you strung our 
guys up in trashy fundoshi!

00:55.950 --> 00:58.450
The hell you talking about, 
you dick-wagging boxer freak?!

00:58.450 --> 01:03.080
You're the one with his dick 
hanging out, you little prick!

01:05.500 --> 01:07.710
Zabu! Why, you...

01:07.710 --> 01:08.780
Hold it!

01:09.090 --> 01:10.840
Zabu, calm down!

01:13.510 --> 01:15.510
<b>Minato Kai</b>

01:14.180 --> 01:15.510
What's that?

01:16.900 --> 01:18.560
Oh, this little thing?

01:18.960 --> 01:21.990
It was lying on the ground next to Outa.

01:22.440 --> 01:25.310
Minato guys would never 
do something so cowardly.

01:25.640 --> 01:27.710
Even you must realize that!

01:37.250 --> 01:39.860
If you're saying it isn't Minato,

01:39.860 --> 01:44.670
then bring the guys who got Outa 
to the Coliseum this time tomorrow.

01:45.180 --> 01:47.170
If you don't, it's war.

01:47.170 --> 01:48.520
You can't...

01:49.860 --> 01:51.490
Kenichiro.

01:52.260 --> 01:54.930
This time, we're going to settle it.

02:08.120 --> 02:09.240
Ken-san...

03:43.120 --> 03:47.460
<b>#04 Stop the War! ~Sometimes You Gotta Eat Goya Chanpuru~</b>

03:45.920 --> 03:47.710
You're really gettin' into it!

03:50.400 --> 03:52.920
Do it for me. Defeat my brother!

03:54.550 --> 03:57.930
<i>Sure! I'll defeat your brother, babe!</i>

04:00.180 --> 04:01.370
Wait.

04:01.370 --> 04:02.550
What's wrong?

04:02.550 --> 04:05.550
If you hurt my brother again, I'll kill you.

04:05.550 --> 04:11.820
Um, so I can't leave a mark on his face, 
but still I have to defeat him?

04:11.820 --> 04:14.070
Hmm? Does that make sense?

04:14.070 --> 04:18.200
Of course it does! Punch him 
in the gut and take him out.

04:18.600 --> 04:20.200
Oh, that's it!

04:20.200 --> 04:23.060
Swing-swing! Get him 
in the body, take him out.

04:23.060 --> 04:25.450
Then get with Mahoro-chan 
and swing-swing, swing-swing,

04:25.450 --> 04:27.200
swing-a-ling!

04:29.920 --> 04:32.620
Er, huh? Seems kinda stuffy.

04:35.750 --> 04:39.470
So because of that, 
we're going to war with Minato.

04:39.470 --> 04:41.830
<i>I don't wanna get involved in this!</i>

04:41.830 --> 04:44.600
Things look really bad this time.

04:44.600 --> 04:47.390
We're gonna slaughter 
every last Minato asshole!

04:47.390 --> 04:49.350
Don't let them get away alive!

04:49.650 --> 04:52.750
The only thing that would come 
from a Siguma-Minato war

04:52.750 --> 04:55.230
is a battle without honor or humanity!

04:55.230 --> 04:58.740
Revenge upon revenge, 
washing blood away with more blood.

04:58.740 --> 05:00.330
An endless hell!

05:01.990 --> 05:04.540
Time for the festivities to begin!

05:04.540 --> 05:07.200
Heave-ho, here we go! Bucchigiri!

05:07.200 --> 05:08.450
Shut your face.

05:10.290 --> 05:13.050
So how is Marito-san taking all this?

05:13.520 --> 05:14.590
Well...

05:15.460 --> 05:19.050
I think he's focused on 
settling his beef with Doman.

05:19.360 --> 05:23.050
Marito-san and that old 
geezer are... settling it?

05:23.050 --> 05:25.550
<b>Aahar Bath</b>

05:23.050 --> 05:25.550
I got a major fight boner!

05:25.950 --> 05:30.700
Let's pile those Siguma punks up and 
send them all to the hospital, yeah?

05:31.050 --> 05:33.470
Talk when you've finished chewing, okay?

05:33.470 --> 05:34.810
Nom, nom!

05:36.310 --> 05:38.880
But I wonder about this.

05:40.680 --> 05:44.030
What? Are you anti-war or something?

05:44.770 --> 05:45.920
I mean,

05:46.610 --> 05:50.860
Minato Kai has always been about man-to-man 
combat. About pursuing our true strength.

05:51.890 --> 05:54.540
Doesn't that belong to Mitsukuni-san?

05:55.240 --> 05:56.290
Yeah.

06:04.630 --> 06:06.010
Matakara.

06:06.900 --> 06:08.510
A Honki Person would never...

06:10.490 --> 06:11.880
...run away.

06:19.320 --> 06:21.240
Keep working to become Honki.

06:21.810 --> 06:24.360
If anyone can do it, you can.

06:26.710 --> 06:30.480
I want to keep my promise to my brother.

06:30.950 --> 06:34.580
And to the Minato Kai 
he cares so much about.

06:35.940 --> 06:41.420
Minato's legendary 42nd leader, 
Asamine Mitsukuni,

06:41.420 --> 06:43.320
is someone we always looked up to.

06:44.310 --> 06:46.970
Doesn't he get out of juvie soon?

06:47.510 --> 06:48.500
Mm-hmm.

06:50.560 --> 06:52.660
Those Siguma punks!

06:52.660 --> 06:55.060
There's no way Minato would 
ambush someone like that!

07:00.450 --> 07:02.330
I've got something to do.

07:02.880 --> 07:04.970
Hey! You aren't eating this?

07:04.970 --> 07:05.720
It's yours.

07:05.720 --> 07:08.120
Yes! I'll take the wiener.

07:08.120 --> 07:10.210
Broccoli for you.

07:10.830 --> 07:15.330
Hey, you haven't been wearing your 
jacket recently. Where's your armband?

07:15.330 --> 07:19.710
Y-Yeah... I hung it out to dry 
and some crows flew away with it.

07:19.710 --> 07:23.600
Crows? Flew away with it, you say?

07:29.340 --> 07:30.750
Was it you?!

07:30.750 --> 07:33.320
I'll grill you into yakitori 
and eat you, damn birds!

07:36.350 --> 07:38.600
<b>Just leave
me alone!</b>

07:36.350 --> 07:38.600
<b>I can't leave
you alone!</b>

07:36.350 --> 07:38.600
<b>Let go!</b>

07:36.350 --> 07:38.600
<b>Takagi-kun...</b>

07:36.350 --> 07:38.600
<b>Natsukawa-san...</b>

07:36.350 --> 07:38.600
<b>I have to tell 
you that I...</b>

07:39.010 --> 07:40.580
Lame.

07:41.020 --> 07:42.110
Hi!

07:42.110 --> 07:44.910
You're Zabu-kun from Minato, right?

07:44.910 --> 07:47.610
What would a half-assed NG like you want?

07:47.610 --> 07:49.850
Just to introduce myself.

07:49.850 --> 07:53.600
How do you do? My name is Shindo Akutaro.

07:54.390 --> 07:55.870
Nice to meet you.

07:56.750 --> 07:59.410
So you're the dude they 
call Emperor or whatever?

07:59.410 --> 08:03.900
Banished from Minato half a year ago 
but still acting the tough guy, huh?

08:03.900 --> 08:07.630
Oh, don't be so cranky. Let's be friendly.

08:07.630 --> 08:08.990
Like hell!

08:08.990 --> 08:12.800
You're just some small fry with a 
head to match. Quit tryin' to show off.

08:28.860 --> 08:31.490
<b><b>Minato Kai</b></b>

08:29.260 --> 08:32.980
Well, you just lost miserably 
to this small fry.

08:34.390 --> 08:36.950
It was so pathetic, I can't tell anyone.

08:39.640 --> 08:41.630
Once we get home, back to training!

08:41.630 --> 08:45.880
There's no need. Marito-san and 
Ken-san are gonna fight each other.

08:45.880 --> 08:47.590
Huh? So what?

08:47.590 --> 08:50.780
You sure are slow! Listen up.

08:50.780 --> 08:53.040
If Marito-san happens to win...

08:57.570 --> 09:00.610
I have achieved all I desired.

09:00.980 --> 09:03.830
I'm leaving the rest to you, Ara-teen.

09:05.160 --> 09:07.400
You can rely on me, Brother.

09:08.420 --> 09:11.110
And if Ken-san wins...

09:13.280 --> 09:16.620
It's up to you now, Ara-teen.

09:17.030 --> 09:20.370
You have no reason to worry. 
I will lead Siguma!

09:29.890 --> 09:31.380
Arajin-kun!

09:32.520 --> 09:34.140
Mahoro-chan!

09:34.680 --> 09:37.510
Oh, my! You've become 
such a handsome young man!

09:37.510 --> 09:39.670
So you were going to the same school?

09:37.510 --> 09:43.520
<b><i>Chu~ Chu~
Chinese Restaurant</i></b>

09:39.670 --> 09:42.050
He doesn't tell me a thing!

09:42.050 --> 09:43.520
I'm back.

09:43.520 --> 09:45.790
Welcome home! Arajin...

09:45.790 --> 09:46.560
Huh?

09:46.560 --> 09:48.330
You have a visitor!

09:55.790 --> 09:58.140
You can't just show up at my home.

09:58.140 --> 09:59.370
Sorry.

09:59.370 --> 10:00.820
What the hell do you want?

10:00.820 --> 10:02.460
Make it quick. I'm hungry.

10:04.310 --> 10:05.560
How's Siguma going?

10:05.560 --> 10:07.090
It's fine.

10:07.430 --> 10:11.450
Tomorrow, we're going to war 
with Siguma. You've heard, right?

10:11.850 --> 10:13.590
Are you going to fight, too?

10:13.590 --> 10:14.870
I don't know.

10:15.690 --> 10:17.550
Depends on the situation.

10:17.970 --> 10:22.850
I want you to stop Marito-kun. 
I'm sure you'd be able to convince him.

10:22.850 --> 10:26.480
Why me? It's none of my business.

10:26.480 --> 10:30.980
Our guys would never ambush someone 
like that. I doubt Siguma would, either.

10:31.450 --> 10:34.240
And... I've got a really bad feeling.

10:34.240 --> 10:37.790
So please. This must be some 
kind of misunderstanding.

10:37.790 --> 10:40.180
We can't fight over something like this.

10:40.180 --> 10:42.850
That isn't what Honki People do!

10:42.850 --> 10:45.000
I said it's none of my business.

10:45.310 --> 10:47.170
But I know you can do it!

10:47.170 --> 10:49.750
I have faith in you, Ara-chan!

10:49.750 --> 10:52.130
Quit talking like a little kid!

10:53.680 --> 10:58.010
<i>He gets so worked up 
when Matakara is around.</i>

10:59.040 --> 11:01.700
You always stood by me, Ara-chan.

11:04.500 --> 11:05.730
This is for you.

11:06.270 --> 11:08.270
<b>Ma</b>

11:06.270 --> 11:08.270
<b>Ara</b>

11:06.270 --> 11:08.270
<b>Jin</b>

11:06.270 --> 11:08.270
<b>Takara</b>

11:10.390 --> 11:11.570
Give it here.

11:17.410 --> 11:19.530
<b>Ma</b>

11:17.410 --> 11:19.530
<b>Ara</b>

11:17.410 --> 11:19.530
<b>Jin</b>

11:17.410 --> 11:19.530
<b>Takara</b>

11:19.530 --> 11:21.790
That's so cool!

11:22.120 --> 11:24.040
It's a best friend stone!

11:24.040 --> 11:26.290
Let's become Honki People together!

11:29.540 --> 11:30.570
Yeah!

11:33.500 --> 11:35.300
I still want that.

11:35.870 --> 11:38.930
I want to become a Honki Person with you!

11:42.810 --> 11:45.260
Just get out! Get out!

11:44.520 --> 11:45.260
Ara-chan!

11:45.260 --> 11:48.540
That's ancient history! 
I don't want to hear it!

11:50.060 --> 11:53.820
What, what, what? They've got so much angst!

11:53.820 --> 11:57.320
<b><i>Chu~ Chu~ Chinese Restaurant</i></b>

12:00.450 --> 12:03.900
Hey, did something happen 
between you and Matakara?

12:04.580 --> 12:07.750
Come on, tell me! Something happened, right?

12:07.750 --> 12:10.380
Hello? Are you even listening?

12:10.380 --> 12:11.700
Hey!

12:13.050 --> 12:14.170
Shut! Up!

12:30.480 --> 12:32.440
<b>Bro gets home! 2 PM</b>

12:33.450 --> 12:34.640
Brother,

12:35.440 --> 12:37.650
I don't know what to do.

12:42.160 --> 12:44.150
Please come home soon.

12:53.880 --> 12:55.840
I know you love these, Big Brother.

12:55.840 --> 12:57.230
Here, open wide.

12:57.230 --> 12:59.090
Mahoro-chan!

12:59.980 --> 13:01.620
It's finally happening.

13:02.410 --> 13:06.040
I'm sure your brother will 
take the top in today's war.

13:06.040 --> 13:09.980
When that happens, he'll be able to rest 
assured and graduate from the gang.

13:09.980 --> 13:14.600
Of course, I, his trusted companion, 
will be asked to take over for him.

13:14.600 --> 13:16.230
I'm sure of that.

13:22.880 --> 13:25.810
Goya Chanpuru, bitter 
as youthful angst. For you!

13:26.240 --> 13:27.990
It ain't even Chinese?!

13:27.990 --> 13:29.490
Oh, right.

13:29.490 --> 13:34.840
Once he finishes off that triple-fundoshi 
gorilla, Brother will be able to graduate,

13:35.210 --> 13:37.380
and then I won't need you anymore.

13:37.380 --> 13:41.610
Um, "won't need" in what sense, exactly?

13:43.180 --> 13:44.520
Can I have a minute?

13:45.000 --> 13:46.390
Matakara?

13:46.390 --> 13:49.390
Back off, man. I don't care what you say—

13:49.390 --> 13:52.020
Jin-san, I'd like to talk to you.

13:52.830 --> 13:54.020
Huh?

13:54.940 --> 13:56.520
About Marito-kun.

14:00.070 --> 14:03.120
You really should stay away 
from these Minato guys.

14:03.120 --> 14:04.710
Hullo, hullo?

14:09.190 --> 14:10.180
Um...

14:11.680 --> 14:13.080
Mahoro-chan?

14:21.090 --> 14:23.220
No way. Is he...

14:23.220 --> 14:25.530
asking Mahoro-chan out?

14:25.530 --> 14:28.980
Well, he is a lot manlier than you.

14:28.980 --> 14:30.500
What chance do you have now?

14:31.100 --> 14:33.790
So? What about my brother?

14:33.790 --> 14:37.090
The war between Minato 
and Siguma is about to begin,

14:37.090 --> 14:39.700
but there's something strange about it.

14:39.700 --> 14:41.990
Like, they aren't acting like themselves.

14:41.990 --> 14:44.110
Could you get to the point?

14:44.460 --> 14:47.870
I'd like you to convince 
Marito-kun to stop the war.

14:47.870 --> 14:51.220
Are you kidding? 
You called me out here for that?

14:51.700 --> 14:52.580
I'm going.

14:52.580 --> 14:55.540
You aren't worried at all for Marito-kun?

14:55.870 --> 14:57.690
They're all acting so bloodthirsty.

14:57.690 --> 15:01.670
At this rate, they might 
end up killing each other.

15:05.310 --> 15:08.440
He wouldn't listen to what I say anyway.

15:12.430 --> 15:15.960
Then persuade Ara-chan to stop Marito-kun!

15:15.960 --> 15:19.150
Huh? There's no way he could handle that.

15:19.150 --> 15:20.270
Yes, he can.

15:20.670 --> 15:22.150
Ara-chan definitely can.

15:24.030 --> 15:25.280
This is going nowhere.

15:25.710 --> 15:26.960
Wait!

15:28.420 --> 15:33.060
I told you. Get your stinking hands off me,
 you sick blockhead!

15:41.840 --> 15:42.880
H-H-H-Hug—

15:42.880 --> 15:44.620
Huggi-huggi-huggi-hugging?!

15:45.090 --> 15:46.840
Hey! Are you okay!

15:47.330 --> 15:49.620
Don't die! Don't die on me!

15:49.620 --> 15:51.430
Pull yourself together, man!

15:52.850 --> 15:54.650
I care too much about Minato

15:55.120 --> 15:57.440
to see them get into 
a misguided war like this.

15:58.130 --> 16:02.170
I want to keep my promise to my big brother!

16:04.190 --> 16:05.150
Oh, sorry!

16:05.550 --> 16:07.120
You probably couldn't breathe.

16:10.000 --> 16:11.840
You've got a big brother, too?

16:11.840 --> 16:14.370
Huh? Yeah.

16:14.770 --> 16:17.490
There's a reason I can't see him right now,

16:17.490 --> 16:19.480
but he's coming home soon.

16:24.160 --> 16:27.400
Hey, is the sky up there pretty big?

16:28.880 --> 16:33.440
Beyond the clouds, I bet there's 
an island I've never seen before.

16:35.010 --> 16:36.520
Mahoro-chan?

16:37.610 --> 16:39.000
Stand up.

16:44.400 --> 16:47.280
Go make my brother stop the war.

16:48.750 --> 16:49.530
Huh?

16:52.000 --> 16:52.990
Pow.

16:57.810 --> 16:59.910
Your wish is my command!

17:03.340 --> 17:07.920
Oh, crap. I'm out of time!

17:08.290 --> 17:10.350
Um, Marito-san.

17:10.350 --> 17:13.180
I understand that you are preparing 
for hostilities with Minato...

17:13.180 --> 17:14.910
Yeah? So?

17:14.910 --> 17:18.140
Oh, nothing! It just sounds so fun!

17:18.140 --> 17:21.490
<i>No way, no way, no way! There's 
no way I can stop him, Mahoro-chan!</i>

17:21.490 --> 17:23.650
Ara-teen, you want a Maji Kebab, too?

17:23.650 --> 17:26.490
I actually just had a bento, so—

17:29.990 --> 17:33.140
Wow! It's piping hot!

17:33.140 --> 17:35.530
I'll just dig right in!

17:38.480 --> 17:44.630
I eat and eat, but it never 
satisfies my hunger.

17:46.590 --> 17:48.460
<b>Minato Kai</b>

17:46.590 --> 17:48.460
Let 'em have it!

17:46.590 --> 17:48.470
Don't go easy on 'em!

17:48.460 --> 17:49.970
We'll show them!

17:48.470 --> 17:51.390
We're gonna murder every 
last one of those Sigumas!

17:50.250 --> 17:53.320
They'll get what's coming to them!

18:07.610 --> 18:10.740
Ken-san! Let's go!

18:07.910 --> 18:10.740
Ken-san! Please listen 
to what I have to say.

18:10.740 --> 18:13.990
Ara-chan is talking to Marito-kun right now!

18:13.990 --> 18:15.140
So just...

18:15.740 --> 18:19.990
<b>The Time Has Come to Settle This</b>

18:19.990 --> 18:21.360
Oh, no...

18:26.880 --> 18:28.340
It's war!

18:28.340 --> 18:30.880
We're gonna humiliate them!

18:31.800 --> 18:33.130
We'll show them!

18:48.810 --> 18:50.270
Matakara...

18:53.880 --> 18:55.060
I...

19:00.160 --> 19:02.310
Oh, dear... What to do?

19:02.740 --> 19:04.230
Yeah, I just have to quit.

19:04.230 --> 19:05.930
Yeah... huh?

19:06.300 --> 19:09.040
Oh, come on!

19:13.800 --> 19:15.710
Welcome in!

19:16.050 --> 19:18.470
The same for today?

19:19.200 --> 19:20.690
I'll take Jasmine-chan.

19:20.690 --> 19:23.560
Okay, one Jasmine-chan combo!

19:23.880 --> 19:27.810
I, uh, I'm sorry I haven't 
been around. Are you mad?

19:27.810 --> 19:29.740
I'm sorry! I said I'm sorry!

19:29.740 --> 19:32.520
No, there isn't anyone else! 
I only have eyes for you!

19:32.520 --> 19:34.560
Please, you have to believe me!

19:36.360 --> 19:40.210
What do I do now? 
If I can't convince Marito-san,

19:40.210 --> 19:43.220
Mahoro-chan is gonna be through with me.

19:43.220 --> 19:46.180
She and Matakara were hitting it off.

19:49.250 --> 19:50.250
H-H-H-Hug—

19:50.250 --> 19:53.560
Huggi-huggi-huggi-hugging?!

19:50.250 --> 19:53.560
Hey! Pull it together!

19:57.770 --> 19:59.800
Out of the way, sonny.

19:59.800 --> 20:02.670
And quit grunting like that. It's a turnoff.

20:02.670 --> 20:05.120
Why don't you run along home, little buddy,

20:05.120 --> 20:06.810
and rub one out or something?

20:07.860 --> 20:11.060
What was that, 
Mr. High-and-Mighty Four-Eyes?

20:11.060 --> 20:12.880
Right now, I'm...

20:12.880 --> 20:16.200
under a hell of a lot of pressure!

20:16.670 --> 20:18.070
Shindo Akutaro.

20:18.860 --> 20:21.450
He's the guy who got Outa-kun.

20:22.100 --> 20:24.850
So Shindo set all of this up?

20:25.580 --> 20:28.530
I'm sorry. It's my fault.

20:30.330 --> 20:31.470
Nah.

20:32.210 --> 20:34.210
Thanks for telling me.

20:34.690 --> 20:36.650
Matakara...

20:37.220 --> 20:38.550
I'm going.

20:39.290 --> 20:41.470
Going? Where?

20:41.870 --> 20:45.720
Even if I tell Marito-kun, 
I doubt he'll believe me.

20:46.090 --> 20:50.040
So I'll go straight to Shindo instead.

20:53.980 --> 20:56.860
Using a weapon, you coward?!

20:56.860 --> 20:58.240
Let's show him!

20:58.240 --> 21:01.130
The fruits of our training!

21:01.130 --> 21:02.360
Oh, yeah!

21:02.360 --> 21:03.240
Your...

21:03.240 --> 21:04.240
My...

21:04.240 --> 21:05.740
...wish is...

21:07.250 --> 21:11.370
...to lose my virginity!

